data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":1255,"item_id":"msg_0244f9efdb5d0e7d016b07c4ac128887d1919ac0ff8807f843","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"sol\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Develop a general food examination and simple mechanical handling operation. The reviewed related capabilities do not cover the whole requested function: probe (open-baseline:probe:1, open.probe) supports observation and small destructive press/wet/heat trials, not controlled opening of a whole food unit; plant-cultivation inspects planting suitability; hearth-food-preparation handles heat preparation and currently accepts roots or berries; consult reads existing records but supplies no new food-use knowledge. Reuse their applicable observation, record-reading and item-state code rather than claiming those mechanisms as new. Search results were incomplete and the query budget is exhausted; the development handoff must check remaining registry contracts for an equivalent mechanical handling operation before adding duplicate code. Missing shell mechanics are a development dependency, not grounds for rejection.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Implement Examine and mechanically handle food as one general operation parameterized by owned inputStackId, quantity (initial executable limit: one whole unit), mode (examine or open), and optional toolIds/supportTargetId. No interface is bound to Sol or to hazelnuts. Exact initial target: item-159-sol-1678, resource hazelnut, quantity 1, origin start-1-nuts, harvestedAt 159. Revalidate current ownership, quantity, reach, condition and actual shell state at execution; the supplied decay 4.38010993 is historical, not a diagnosis of visible spoilage. Do not touch reserve root stack item-155-sol-1631.\\\\nExamine costs one active round and 0.2 energy, with no material consumption. It reports only externally perceivable shape, surface, visible damage, exposed interior and observable spoilage signs, explicitly marking unobserved properties unknown. Any statements of established personal food-use knowledge must cite an actual accessible personal record and its evidence, not resource labels, hidden nutritional/toxin fields or the developer's general knowledge. Sol has no supplied evidence establishing raw safety. Retain uncertainty even if no spoilage is visible. Opening is not tasting, cooking, detoxification or consumption.\\\\nOpen attempts one mechanically supported separation per active round at 0.5 energy. First executable scope is manual peeling, splitting or shell opening where actual grip and force suffice, or cracking with an explicitly selected reachable suitable owned implement and stable accessible support. No stone, tool, bench or food is supplied. start-1-stone is an observed natural source, not an owned hammer; gathering or reaching it remains a separate paid action. Validate force, contact geometry, support stability, material resistance and tool wear through existing physical/material code. If those mechanisms are missing, add the minimal resistance-and-force test and separation transaction in the current development handoff; never let the language model decide success repeatedly at runtime. Do not infer that fingers can crack this hazelnut. With inadequate prerequisites, report a blocked attempt without energy or world-time charge; an actually performed unsuccessful trial pays its round and energy and records any real damage. A damaged but unopened shell is not an opened product.\\\\nReuse existing item identity, ownership, age, treatment, spoilage and observation machinery, recording reused handlers/modules and revisions in the implementation manifest. Where composition is not represented, introduce a conserved composition ledger before separating products: shell, interior, fragments and losses must partition the original material and original food/nutrition entitlement, never create extra whole edible units or reset age. Do not invent numerical shell mass from the supplied resource label. Outputs retain parent/origin references and current condition; debris and discarded material remain at the work location. A physically exposed interior is described as exposed, not certified edible. Any later eating uses eat and actual applicable nutrition/toxicity rules.\\\\nEach completed round commits observations, damage, wear, energy and material transfers atomically. Persist target, selected method, completed separations and accumulated damage as progress; unworked rounds pause without productive progress. Resume revalidates ownership, reach, tools, energy and current material state. Cancel releases reservations and stops further work; death does likewise and leaves actual items/products under the existing death-placement rules. Neither restores damage, consumed effort or discarded material; no duplicate refund or new inventory. No automatic continuing process, maintenance bonus or accelerated preservation is introduced; ordinary ageing continues during elapsed world rounds. No ongoing maintenance beyond prerequisites for each active step. Development/review waiting itself advances no world time. Other participants, if any, must independently communicate and execute their own actions; no consent, assistance or skill is inferred.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Sol studies individually for one round after implementation; approval is not mastery. Inspection, requests, registration, study and action invocation award no automatic wellbeing. This initial capability makes no direct pleasure, satisfaction, comfort, nutrition or reward-account changes. A genuinely new, evidence-backed observation or informative failed trial may be submitted to an already implemented experience rule only if it verifies personal information gain; unknown or inconclusive results alone do not qualify. Any such existing rule must enforce its bounded amount, per-fact functional deduplication, cooldown and decay rather than reward repeated inspection or renamed records. Familiar legitimate handling may receive only an existing modest practice benefit under its real-event conditions, never a new unconditional bonus. Basic nutrition remains governed by actual consumption and is not reduced by mood; no protected accounts, budgets, goals or permissions change.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable examine-start/completed, handling-start, blocked, trial-failed, material-damaged, shell-opened, paused, resumed and cancelled events only when their corresponding events actually occur. Reuse visual metadata with operation/mode, actor, target and product IDs, position, progress, actual shell state, visible fragments, tool contact and evidence/uncertainty fields. An examination can show an observation indicator but not an edible/safe badge. Failed or unfinished opening retains the actual closed or damaged appearance and cannot display a revealed kernel or success animation. Show an exposed interior only after the conserved separation transaction commits; no invented products, glow or wellbeing effects.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

